      "text": "[7:58AM]  #LekkiEpeExpWay\n#Ajah\n#TrafficUpdate \n\nWe have excellent vehicular movement from Ilaje to Ajah under Jubilee bridge en-route Addo Badore road (both inwards and outwards) connecting  Alesh.\n\nMovements Inward and outward Abraham Adesanya looks good.\nconnecting Lekki-garden phase 2, Alasia, LBS, Olokonla to Ogidan, Sangotedo and ShopRite are all moving rapidly.\n\n From ShopRite down to Abijo, Awoyaya, Lakowe, dodlwn to Eleko junction is also in good shape\nLikewise the return journey from Eleko junction back to Ajah under bridge and en-route  Alesh is in good shape.\n#FollowLASTMA",
