    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "1943573985943294069",
      "url": "https://x.com/followlastma/status/1943573985943294069",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/followlastma/status/1943573985943294069",
      "text": "[8:27AM] #LagIbdExp\n#3MB\n#TrafficUpdate\n\nTraffic is very encouraging from Kara bridge through Berger Oke down to Emergency point.\nIt's a bit slow at 7up due to bus stop activities but faster moving ahead to Estate, Ogudu, Ifako and Iyana Oworo.\n\nThe stretch of the Third mainland bridge looks good for now as well.\n\nComing from Ilubirin, Adeniji through the Third mainland back to Iyana Oworo is good, then moves slowly approaching Car wash towards the Rehabilitation point at Ifako.\n\nExiting Ifako all the way to Tollgate and Berger is better.\n#FollowLASTMA\n@Sola_Giwa \n@lagostraffic961 \n@TrafficChiefNG \n@trafficpalava",
